          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149018,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Já vimos como adicionar novos elementos. Agora vamos aprender como remover elementos, assim como este HUD do jogo faz quando os jogadores clicam no botão.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;hud&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Game HUD&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;toggleEnemies()&quot; id=&quot;toggle&quot;&gt;Hide&#xA;   Enemies&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p id=&quot;Slime&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Slime:&lt;/strong&gt; HP 10&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p id=&quot;Bat&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bat:&lt;/strong&gt; HP 6&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   const firstID = &quot;Slime&quot;;&#xA;   const secondID = &quot;Bat&quot;;&#xA;   &#xA;   function toggleEnemies() {&#xA;    const button = document.getElementById(&quot;toggle&quot;);&#xA;    const hudElement = document.getElementById(&quot;hud&quot;);&#xA;    if (toggle.innerHTML === &quot;Show Enemies&quot;) {&#xA;     const p1 = document.createElement(&quot;p&quot;);&#xA;     p1.innerHTML = &quot;&lt;strong&gt;Slime:&lt;/strong&gt; HP 10&quot;;&#xA;     p1.id = firstID;&#xA;     const p2 = document.createElement(&quot;p&quot;);&#xA;     p2.innerHTML = &quot;&lt;strong&gt;Bat:&lt;/strong&gt; HP 6&quot;;&#xA;     p2.id = secondID;&#xA;     hudElement.appendChild(p1);&#xA;     hudElement.appendChild(p2);&#xA;     button.innerHTML = &quot;Hide Enemies&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     const p1 = document.getElementById(firstID);&#xA;     const p2 = document.getElementById(secondID);&#xA;     hudElement.removeChild(p1);&#xA;     hudElement.removeChild(p2);&#xA;     button.innerHTML = &quot;Show Enemies&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149019,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Precisamos identificar o elemento que queremos remover e seu pai. Use <code>id=\"hud\"</code> e <code>id=\"enemy\"</code> para identificar os elementos.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;hud&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;enemy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Slime: HP 10\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;script.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"75\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"d\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>id</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e depois <code>\"hud\"</code>, <code>id=\"enemy\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149020,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agora podemos acessar os elementos dentro do arquivo de script. Podemos criar uma variável <code>hudElement</code> para armazenar o elemento pai.</p><p>Acesse o elemento pai usando <code>document.getElementById()</code> com o ID <code>\"hud\"</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;hud&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;enemy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Slime: HP 10\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;script.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hudElement = \" /><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".getElementById(\" /><text value=\"&quot;hud&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>hudElement</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e depois <code>document</code>, <code>.getElementById</code>, <code>(\"hud\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
