          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149021,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Também precisamos acessar o elemento filho. Crie uma variável <code>enemyLine</code> para armazenar o elemento que queremos remover, usando <code>getElementById(\"enemy\")</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;hud&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;enemy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Slime: HP 10\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;script.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"101\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hudElement = \" /><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".getElementById(\" /><text value=\"&quot;hud&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyLine = \" /><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".getElementById(\" /><text value=\"&quot;enemy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>enemyLine</code> seguido de <code>document</code> e depois <code>.getElementById</code>, <code>(\"enemy\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
